{
 "format": "fnv.observe.campaign/1",
 "name": "cdc_leash",
 "title": "Issue #2155 (2026-11-11): how far actors on Continue During Combat packages move in combat. On the Searchlight Airport runway (save nvfairport), one actor at a time is spawned 500, 1,000 or 2,000 units up the runway from the standing player (god mode), given its package there by AddScriptPackage at sample 60 (so 'near current location' is that spot), set on the player with StartCombat at sample 300 and stopped with StopCombat at sample 1400 (about 15 samples a second). The leash is the actor's greatest distance from the spot where it got the package. Melee troopers (a knife), rifle troopers (control), a coyote, and V22FemaleMantis on its own flagged package; '_none' sessions are the baseline with no package given; '_away' sessions teleport the player 1,500 units down the runway at sample 900.",
